irection":"RULED (section 22 (i)): the costlier cell of a pair is read at U_P and the cheaper at the smallest snapshot of the MC grid whose cumulative cost is at least that; the two cost measures giving different costlier cells is MC-AMBIGUOUS (not established)","mc_snapshot_grid":"READING: a multiplier above 6 has no snapshot on the MC grid and is MC-SHORT","movement":"READING: the row-movement ratio printed with a verdict is the larger cell's total value-row movement over the smaller's at U_P, with the without-gradient share ratio beside it; OPTIMIZER-ASSISTED tests the share ratio; efficiency verdicts also print both at each cell's hit snapshot","panels":"RULED (ADR-0021 section 22 (h)): for a label that favours the store (TREE_AHEAD, TREE_COMPETITIVE and every positive condition) a replicate counts only if both panels satisfy it; for a label that blocks (DENSE AHEAD, DENSE FASTER) a replicate counts if either panel satisfies it; PANEL-DISAGREE is the verdict when the panels give different verdicts","robustness":"RULED (section 22 (n)): robustness is read on Panel A and printed for both panels, accuracy retained = mean raw accuracy over three seeded masks; descriptive","seed_block_readouts":"RULED (section 22 (m)): the seed block's spread is reported at U_P and U_run; descriptive","simulation_setting":"RATIFIED (section 22 (c)): page misses at 8 rows per page, rho = 1/4, ascending tie rule; descriptive, enters no rule"},"returns_to_lead":["at 4,096 slots neither load 2 nor load 8 is loaded: no registered 4,096-slot cell is predicted loaded"],"schema":1,"source_hashes":{"studies/p10s1/__init__.py":"b6368003f8755c285e366d671e5c0dfd3f65c77cf1b4d892afff0d8784306133","studies/p10s1/analysis.py":"2582b8a1f1d728632e87e85b9102118c857bfc2356bac4d8c7b42a4e6e4d36ed","studies/p10s1/budget.py":"33bba0d73df7d8a409e51a3b8da30bcce041f82635704c5f9f457a70f6df0844","studies/p10s1/calibrate.py":"1f6b1237b560d0aa49dff914a44ac58cb28654013ef8dc6067c5706fb25e132d","studies/p10s1/classes